#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog tables are not partitioned.  Traditional (non-partitioned) tables are deprecated, and partitioned tables are required for new installs.  Your data will continue to be collected, but you should migrate the syslog table to a partitioned architecture."
msgstr "Tsy voazarazara ny tabilao Syslog. Ny tabilao mahazatra (tsy voazarazara) dia efa lany andro, ary ny tabilao voazarazara no takiana ho an'ny fametrahana vaovao. Hitohy hatrany ny fanangonana ny angonao, saingy tokony hafindranao amin'ny rafitra voazarazara ny tabilao syslog."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Waiting for a completed processing run."
msgstr "Miandry ny fahavitan'ny fanodinana."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Processing is completing within the allowed delay."
msgstr "Ny fanodinana dia vita ao anatin'ny fe-potoana azo ekena."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "No processing run has completed for more than %d seconds."
msgstr "Tsy nisy fihazakazahana fikirakirana vita nandritra ny mihoatra ny %d segondra."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Incoming messages are within the configured limits."
msgstr "Ao anatin'ny fetra voarindra ny hafatra miditra."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Incoming queue metrics are unavailable."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny fandrefesana ny filaharana miditra."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Incoming backlog of at least %s messages exceeds the limit of %s."
msgstr "Ny lahatra miditra miandry farafahakeliny hafatra %s dia mihoatra ny fetra %s."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The oldest incoming message timestamp is unavailable."
msgstr "Tsy azo ny marik'ora tranainy indrindra amin'ny hafatra miditra."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Unprocessed messages are older than %d seconds."
msgstr "Ny hafatra tsy mbola voakarakara dia mihoatra ny %d segondra."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization is not enabled on this collector."
msgstr "Tsy mavitrika eo amin'ity mpanangona ity ny fampifanarahana."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization is within the allowed delay."
msgstr "Ao anatin'ny fe-potoana nahazoana alalana ny fampifanarahana."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization queue metrics are unavailable."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny refy momba ny laharan'ny fampifanarahana miandry."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The oldest synchronization record timestamp is unavailable."
msgstr "Tsy azo ny marik'ora tranainy indrindra amin'ny firaketana fampifanarahana."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Synchronization has failed or queued records exceed the allowed delay."
msgstr "Tsy nahomby ny fampifanarahana na mihoatra ny fe-potoana nahazoana alalana ny firaketana miandry."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Partition maintenance is not blocked."
msgstr "Tsy voasakana ny fikojakojana ny fizarana."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Partition maintenance is blocked: %s"
msgstr "Voasakana ny fikojakojana ny fizarana: %s"

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog pipeline health - collector %d"
msgstr "Fahasalaman'ny fantsona Syslog - mpanangona %d"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog pipeline has recovered."
msgstr "Tafarina ny fantsom-pikorianan'ny Syslog."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "Partition layout for %s is invalid or incomplete; partition maintenance stopped. Verify the partition metadata with SHOW CREATE TABLE and, if required, rebuild the partitions; writes continue into the dMaxValue safety partition."
msgstr "Tsy manan-kery na tsy feno ny fandrafetana fizarana ho an'ny %s; nijanona ny fikojakojana ny fizarana. Hamarino ny metadata-n'ny fizarana amin'ny alalan'ny SHOW CREATE TABLE ary, raha ilaina, amboary indray ny fizarana; mitohy ao amin'ny fizarana fiarovana dMaxValue ny fanoratana."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "remaining partition gap: %d partition(s)"
msgstr "elanelan'ny fizarana sisa tavela: fizarana %d"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "no retention deferral"
msgstr "tsy misy fanemorana ny fitazonana"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "retention pruning deferred until the future horizon is restored"
msgstr "nahemotra ny fanesorana fitazonana mandra-pamerina ny faravodilanitra ho avy"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "new records are accumulating in the dMaxValue safety partition"
msgstr "mitombo ao amin'ny fizarana fiarovana dMaxValue ireo firaketana vaovao"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "per run recovery limit reached"
msgstr "tratran'ny fetran'ny famerenana isaky ny fandehanana"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "partition creation failed"
msgstr "tsy nahomby ny famoronana fizarana"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Unknown partitioning level; choose Hourly or Daily."
msgstr "Ambaratonga fizarazarana tsy fantatra; safidio ny Isan'ora na Isan'andro."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog retention is invalid."
msgstr "Tsy manan-kery ny fe-potoana fitahirizana Syslog."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Hourly partitioning cannot be used with Indefinite retention, which would need an unbounded number of partitions. Choose a retention period or Daily partitioning."
msgstr "Tsy azo ampiasaina miaraka amin'ny fitahirizana tsy misy fetra ny fizarana isan'ora, satria mitaky fizarana tsy misy fetra izany. Mifidiana fe-potoana fitahirizana na fizarana isan'andro."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s partitioning with %s days of retention and a %s day pre-create window needs %s partitions per table, which exceeds this database server's limit of %s partitions. Reduce the retention, shorten the pre-create window, or choose Daily partitioning."
msgstr "Ny fizarazarana %s miaraka amin'ny fitazonana %s andro sy vanim-potoana famoronana mialoha %s andro dia mila fizarazaran-tabilao %s isaky ny tabilao, izay mihoatra ny fetra %s amin'ity mpizara tahiry ity. Ahenao ny faharetan'ny fitazonana, hafohezo ny vanim-potoana famoronana mialoha, na misafidiana fizarazarana Isan'andro."

