#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Mpanolotsaina fanavaozana Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Havaozina ho ambony kokoa ve ny Syslog manomboka amin'ny %s ho %s? Hotehirizina ny hafatra sy ny fitsipika efa misy. Mety haharitra ny fanovana ny rafitra."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Inona ny karazana fanavaozana/fametrahana irinao hampiasaina"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Rehefa manana tabilao tena lehibe ianao, dia haingana kokoa ny manao Truncate. Raha manahy momba ny angona tahiry ianao, dia afaka misafidy na Inline, izay hampijanona ny navigateur-nao mandritra ity fanavaozana ity, na background, izay hamorona fizotra ambadika mba hitondrana ny angona syslog taloha avy amin'ny tabilao tahiry ho amin'ny endrika syslog vaovao. Indray mandeha dia mety haharitra ora maromaro ity fizotra ity. Ny Truncate dia manary ny hafatra syslog voatahiry sy nesorina ihany; voatahiry foana ny fitsipika fanairana, fanesorana ary tatitra."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Fafao ny latabatra Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Fanavaozana an-toerana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Fanavaozana any ambadika"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Motera fitehirizana angon-drakitra"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Ny milina fitahirizana ho an'ny tabilao famakafakana. Ny milina fitahirizana InnoDB sy, amin'ny MariaDB, ny Aria ihany no tohanana. Izay safidy Mpanangona Angon-drakitra Lavitra dia mitaky InnoDB; tsy azo alefa ny fitambarana tsy mifanaraka."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Fitahirizana InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Fitehirizana Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Fahamarinan'ny mariky ny fotoana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Ny fahamarinana milisegondra dia mitahiry ny mari-potoana syslog latsaky ny iray segondra ao anaty tsanganana TIMESTAMP(3) ary amin'ny MariaDB ihany no misy azy.  Ny fahamarinana segondra dia mampiasa tsanganana TIMESTAMP mahazatra.  Amin'ny rafitra famokarana, ampiasao ny cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms mandritra ny fotoana fikojakojana mba hanovana ireo hafatra efa misy nefa tsy manary azy ireo."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisegondra - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB ihany)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Segondra - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Fikarakarana hafatra lavitra"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Alefaso ny fikirakirana hafatra avy amin'ny mpanangona angona lavitra"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Raha manana tahiry angona Syslog azy manokana ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra ary mikirakira ny hafany samirery, dia mariho ity boaty fanamarinana ity. Amin'ny fanamarihana ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia mila mitazona ny rakitra 'config_local.php' azy manokana ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra mba hampahafantarana ny Syslog hampiasa tahiry angona mahaleo tena amin'ny fampisehoana sy fikirakirana hafatra. Azafady ampiasao ny rakitra modely 'config_local.php.dist' ho amin'izany. FAMPITANDREMANA: Hoforonina ho azy ny tabilao Syslog raha vao mavitrika ity safidy ity."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Fampifanarahana ny fitsipiky ny mpanangona angona lavitra"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Raha manana tahiry angona Syslog azy manokana ny Mpanangona Angona Lavitra ary mikirakira ny hafany samirery, dia mariho ity boaty fanamarinana ity raha tianao halefa any amin'ny Rafitra Cacti Lavitra ny fitsipika Fanairana, Fanesorana ary Tatitra avy amin'ny tahiry angona Cacti Fototra."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Tehirizo ao amin'ny mpanangona lavitra ny rakitra"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Tehirizo ao amin'ny tabilao syslog an'ny mpanangona lavitra ireo hafatra voakarakara rehefa avy nalefa tany amin'ny Mpanangona Foibe. Rehefa tsy mavitrika izany dia voatahiry eo an-toerana ihany ny firaketana raha mbola tsy hita ny Mpanangona Foibe ary esorina rehefa voamarina fa tafaverina sy voaray."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Politikan'ny fitahirizana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Safidio ny isan'ny andro tianao hitahirizana ny sanda Syslog ao amin'ny tahirin-kevitra."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Ambaratongan'ny fizarana"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Ny haben'ny fizarana tsirairay amin'ny tabilao syslog sy syslog_removed. Ny Isan'andro no soso-kevitra. Ny Isan'ora dia mitaky fe-potoana fitahirizana voafetra, ary ny fitahirizana sy ny haavon'ny fizarazarana miaraka dia tsy maintsy antonona ny fetran'ny fizarazarana ao amin'ny mpizara angon-drakitra. Raha hanova ny haavo any aoriana, ovao ao amin'ny Fandrindrana ary alefaso ny cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Havaozy"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Hametraka"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Mpanolotsaina Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "FAMPITANDREMANA: Mandany fotoana be ny fanavaozana ny Syslog!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Ny fanavaozana ny tabilao 'main' an'ny syslog dia mety ho dingana mandany fotoana be. Noho izany, amporisihina ianao mba hampihena ny haben'ny tabilao syslog alohan'ny hanavaozana, na hisafidy ny safidy any ambadika."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Raha misafidy ny safidy any ambadika ianao, dia hovana anarana ny tabilao syslog taloha, ary hoforonina ny tabilao syslog vaovao. Avy eo, halefa any ambadika ny dingana fanavaozana. Indray mandeha, mety haharitra elaela ny fahavitan'io dingana any ambadika io. Na izany aza, dia ho voatahiry ny angonao."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Na inona na inona safidinao, dia ho tazonina mandritra ny dingana fanavaozana avokoa ny fitsipika fanalana sy fampandrenesana efa misy."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Tsindrio ny <b>'Havaozy'</b> hanohizana ny fanavaozana, na <b>'Foano'</b> hiverenana any amin'ny menio Plugins."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Azonao atao koa ny mametraka ny motera fitahirizan'ny tahiry angona ho an'ny tabilao famakafakana syslog sy syslog_remove. Ny motera fitahirizana InnoDB ihany, ary ao amin'ny MariaDB ny motera fitahirizana Aria, no tohana. Raha mampiasa MariaDB, dia manoro hevitra ny Motera Fitahirizana Aria izahay rehefa tsy misy safidy Mpanangona Angona Lavitra mavitrika; ny safidy mpanangona dia mitaky InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Manana safidy maromaro azo isafidianana ianao rehefa mametraka ny Syslog.  Ny voalohany dia ny Rafitry ny Tahirin-kevitra.  Ny tabilao voazarazara ihany no rafitra tohana satria misoroka ny haben'ny tabilao tsy ho lasa lehibe loatra ka mampiadana ny fangatahana.  Ny tabilao mahazatra tsy voazarazara dia efa lany andro ary tsy atolotra intsony ho an'ny fametrahana vaovao."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Azonao atao koa ny misafidy ny fahamarinan'ny marik'ora. Ny fahamarinan'ny milisegondra (TIMESTAMP(3)) dia mitahiry ny filaharan'ny hafatra miditra latsaky ny iray segondra ary amin'ny MariaDB ihany no misy azy; ny fametrahana MySQL dia mampiasa ny fahamarinan'ny segondra. Tsy azo ovaina eo no ho eo aty aoriana izany raha tsy manimba ireo hafatra voatahiry."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Tsy misy ny fitehirizana Aria raha mbola misy safidy Mpanangona angona lavitra mavitrika. Voasafidy ny InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Azonao atao koa ny misafidy ny faharetan'ny fitahirizana. Tadidio azafady fa raha manana Mpampiantrano maromaro manoratra any amin'ny syslog ianao, dia mety ho lasa tena lehibe ity tabilao ity."

