msgstr "Inona ny fomba fanesorana tianao hampiasaina?"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When uninstalling syslog, you can remove everything, or only components, just in case you plan on re-installing in the future."
msgstr "Rehefa manala ny syslog, dia azonao atao ny manala ny zava-drehetra, na singa sasany ihany, raha toa ka mikasa ny hametraka azy indray ianao amin'ny hoavy."

#: includes/installer.php
