#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Fikirana ankapobeny"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog Mavitrika"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia hafindra avy ao amin'ny tabilao Syslog Incoming mankany amin'ny tabilao syslog fototra ny firaketana ary havelona ny Fanairana sy Tatitra. Tadidio fa na tsy mavitrika aza ny rafitra dia mbola hiangona ao amin'ny tabilao Syslog Incoming ihany ny firaketana log satria voafaritry ny dingana rsyslog na syslog-ng izany."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Alefaso any amin'ny Mpitantana Fanairana ny fanairana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Avelao ny fitsipika napetraka amin'ny Mpitantana Fanairana handefa fanairana. Ny mailaka Syslog no mijanona ho vahaolana faharoa; ny asa baiko dia mandeha ho an'ny fitsipika Fanairana Syslog ihany."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Esory ny sehatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Lisitry ny sehatra (domains) sarahin'ny faingo izay tianao hesorina amin'ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano Syslog, ohatra ny 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fanavaozana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Ity no fotoana amin'ny segondra alohan'ny hanavaozana ny pejy."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Dingano ny fanisana ny fitambaran'ny andalana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia tsy manisa ny firaketana mifanaraka rehetra ny tabilao System Logs sy Alert Logs, izay mety mandany hery be amin'ny fametrahana lehibe. Mampiseho rohy Teo aloha sy Manaraka ny pejy fa tsy totaly sy lisitry ny pejy, ary atolotra ny Manaraka raha mbola misy firaketana tavela."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Firaketana tatitra farany ambony"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Ho an'ny Fampandrenesana mifototra amin'ny Fetra, inona no isa farany ambony tianao haseho ao amin'ny tatitra.  Izany dia ampiasaina hamerana ny haben'ny diarin'ny html sy ny Mailaka."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "%d Firaketana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Fizotra fikarakarana Syslog farany ambony"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Rehefa apetraka mihoatra ny 1, dia aparitaka amin'ny fizotry ny mpiasa mifanindry ny fikarakarana ny hafatra miditra. Ny mpiasa tsirairay dia mikarakara sokajy hafatra miditra samy hafa, izay manafaingana ny famahana ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano sy ny famindrana hafatra rehefa mavesatra ny entana. Ny sanda 1 dia mikarakara ny hafatra rehetra ao amin'ny fizotra tokana. Tsy tohana amin'ny Windows na rehefa tsy misy ny fanitarana PHP pcntl sy POSIX ny fizotry ny mpiasa, ka raha izany dia miverina amin'ny fizotra tokana ny fikarakarana."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "%d Fizotra mpanatanteraka"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "%d Fizotra mpanatanteraka"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Baiko fanokafana tapakila"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Hotanterahina ity baiko ity mba hanokafana Tapakila Help Desk. Ilaina ny baiko hamakafaka masontsibina fampidirana maromaro toy izao manaraka izao: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Ny hostlist dia ho lisitry ny mpampiantrano sarahina faingo izay voakasiky ny fampitandremana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Safidy amin'ny fitadiavana Mpampiantrano"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Alefaso ny famahana anaran'ny mpampiantrano"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia vahana amin'ny alalan'ny fikarohana DNS aloha ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano rehetra (raha mavitrika), amin'ny fampiasana firaketana A sy AAAA. Tsy mila fikarohana ny adiresy IPv4 sy IPv6, ary tahirizina amin'ny endrika zana-tsoratra voafintina ny adiresy IPv6. Raha tsy mahomby ny fikarohana DNS, dia hanandrana hamaha ny anaran'ny mpampiantrano ao amin'ny tabilao Mpampiantrano Cacti ny rafitra ary hanolo azy amin'ny famaritana ny Mpampiantrano Cacti. Raha tsy mahomby avokoa ny fikarohana DNS sy Cacti, dia omena tovana aloha 'unresolved-Original_hostname' ny firaketana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Dingano ny famahana DNS ho an'ny mpampiantrano miditra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia tsy hanandrana hamaha Mpampiantrano amin'ny alalan'ny fikarohana DNS ny rafitra. Ilaina izany amin'ny tontolo tsy ahafahana na tsy iriana ny famahana DNS."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Fandrindrana ny fampandrenesana HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Alefaso ny mailaka mifototra amin'ny HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Raha voamarika ity boaty fanamarinana ity, dia halefa amin'ny endrika HTML ny Mailaka rehetra. Raha tsy izany, dia halefa amin'ny lahatsoratra tsotra ny Mailaka."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Rakitra endrika hampiasaina"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Safidio ny rakitra fonony html namboarina sy CSS hampiasaina. Ity rakitra ity dia misy html sy CSS hamonosana ny tatitrao. Raha mihoatra noho ny CSS tsotra no ao anatiny dia mila mametraka marika manokana <REPORT> ao anatin'ny rakitra ianao. Io marika endrika io dia hosoloina ny votoatin'ny tatitra. Ireo rakitra ireo dia ao amin'ny lahatahiry 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Fitahirizana sy fizarana angona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Fitehirizana Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Ity no isan'ny andro itahirizana ny zava-mitranga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Ny haben'ny fizarana tsirairay amin'ny tabilao syslog sy syslog_removed. Voatahiry eto ny fanovana saingy tsy manan-kery raha tsy rehefa manamboatra indray ireo tabilao roa ireo ny cli/upgrade_partitioning.php; mandra-pahatongan'izany, mitazona ny habe efa misy ny fikojakojana ny fizarana. Ny fizarazarana isan'ora dia mitaky fe-potoana fitahirizana voafetra. Ny fitahirizana, ny varavarankely famoronana mialoha ary ny haavon'ny fizarazarana miaraka dia tsy maintsy antonona ny fetran'ny fizarazarana ao amin'ny mpizara angon-drakitra, raha tsy izany dia tsy voatahiry ny fandrindrana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana famoronana mialoha ny fizarana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Ity no isan'ny andron'ny fizarana ho avy tazonina ho an'ny tabilao Syslog voazarazara, mba hisaraka foana avy amin'ny fizarana dMaxValue tsy misy na inona na inona ny fizarana vaovao. Ny fizarana isan'ora dia mitazona fara fahakeliny 2 andro foana."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "%d Andro"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "%d Andro"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Fetra famerenana ny fizarana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Rehefa misy fizarana banga (ohatra aorian'ny fijanonana noho ny fikojakojana), dia io isa farafahabetsany io ihany no hamoronana fizarana banga isaky ny tabilao amin'ny fihodinana Poller tsirairay. Ny elanelana sisa tavela dia hositranina amin'ny fihodinana manaraka; nahemotra ny fanapahana fitahirizana mandra-pamerina tanteraka ny faravodilanitry ny fizarana ho avy. Mihatra amin'ny tabilao Syslog voazarazara ihany."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "%d Fizarana isaky ny fanatanterahana"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "%d Fizarana isaky ny fanatanterahana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Fetra fahanteran'ny mpanangona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Mampitandrina ny fampandrenesana ny fahasalaman'ny pipeline rehefa mihoatra io fahatarana io ny hafatra tsy mbola voakarakara, ny fahavitan'ny fikarakarana, na ny fampifanarahana miandry. Ny fahatarana tena izy dia farafahakeliny elanelam-potoana Poller telo sy 300 segondra. Apetraho ho 0 raha hampiasa 300 segondra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Mahazatra (300 segondra)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "%d segondra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Backlog Threshold"
msgstr "Fetra fiandrasan'ny mpanangona"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
