#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Fampandrenesana ny fahasalaman'ny pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Lisitry ny fampahafantarana ny fahasalaman'ny pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Misafidiana lisitra fampandrenesana Thold efa misy ho an'ny fanairana momba ny fahasalaman'ny fantsona fikirakirana. Ny mpandray ao amin'ny lisitra Mavitrika dia atambatra amin'ireo adiresy mailaka eto ambany, sady mitazona ireo mpandray BCC. Ny lisitra dia mitaky ny latabatry ny lisitra fampandrenesana Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Mpandray Mailaka momba ny fahasalaman'ny pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Mpandray mailaka sarahin'ny faingo ho an'ny tsy fahombiazana sy ny fanarenana ny fantsona. Avelao ho banga ary aza misafidy lisitra fampandrenesana raha hanajanona ny mailaka; mijanona ho hita eo amin'ny tabilao Sata ny fahasalamana ary voarakitra an-tsoratra ny fiovan'ny toe-javatra. Mila mandeha ny Poller Cacti mba hanaovana ny fanamarinana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Elanelam-potoana fampahatsiahivana ny fahasalaman'ny pipeline"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Avereno ny fampandrenesana momba ny olana mitohy amin'ny fantsona fikarakarana rehefa dila io elanelam-potoana io. Tsy averina indray mandeha isaky ny dimy minitra mahery ny fikasana handefa mailaka tsy nahomby."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Fitehirizana ny fanairana Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Ity no isan'ny andro itahirizana ny rakitra fampandrenesana."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Fanakanana fampandrenesana sy fikojakojana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Andron'ny fotoam-pikojakojana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Andro hanginana ny fampandrenesana fanairana rehetra mandritra ny fe-potoana fikojakojana voarindra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Fanombohan'ny fotoam-pikojakojana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Ora fanombohana an-toerana ho an'ny fotoam-pikojakojana ankapobeny."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Faran'ny fotoam-pikojakojana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Ora famaranana an-toerana ho an'ny fotoam-pikojakojana ankapobeny. Mitohy amin'ny ampitso ny ora famaranana aloha kokoa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Fanombohan'ny fikojakojana indray mandeha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Daty sy ora eo an-toerana safidy hanombohana ny varavarankelin'ny fikojakojana ankapobeny indray mandeha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Fiafaran'ny fikojakojana indray mandeha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Daty sy ora eo an-toerana safidy hamaranana ny varavarankelin'ny fikojakojana ankapobeny indray mandeha. Endrika: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Fotoana fampanginana fanairana mahazatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Ajanony mandritra ity isa minitra ity ny fampandrenesana miverimberina ho an'ny fitsipika sy faritra tatitra mitovy. Ny sanda isaky ny fitsipika dia manafoana ity Fandrindrana ity. Apetraho ho 0 mba ho tsy mavitrika."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Fanafoanana dika mitovy mahazatra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Ajanony mandritra ity isa minitra ity ny fampandrenesana mitovy andiana hafatra mifanaraka. Ny sanda isaky ny fitsipika dia manafoana ity Fandrindrana ity. Apetraho ho 0 mba ho tsy mavitrika."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Famerenana Syslog lavitra"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Firaketana fanarenana farany ambony isaky ny fanatanterahana"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Isan'ny hetsika Syslog lavitra voatahiry farany ambony alefa any amin'ny Mpanangona Fototra amin'ny fanatanterahana iray ataon'ny mpiasa mpanarina. Ny fifanakalozana tsirairay ao amin'ny tahirin-kevitra foibe dia mijanona voafetra ho firaketana 100. Ampitomboy tsikelikely sady manara-maso ny enta-mavesatra sy ny fiandrasana hidy ao amin'ny Mpanangona Fototra."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Fiatoana fanarenana eo anelanelan'ny andiany"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Fiatoana eo anelanelan'ny fifanakalozana fanaterana rakitra 100 an'ny Main Collector tsirairay. Ny fiatoana lava kokoa dia mampihena ny tsindry amin'ny Main Collector; ny fiatoana fohy kokoa dia manafaingana ny fanefana ny asa miandry."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Tsy misy fiatoana"

