#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Ny kaody hafatra hotadiavina, ohatra %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN na 4625. Tsy maintsy mitovy amin'ny teny iray manontolo ao amin'ny hafatra syslog izany (litera, isa ary _ . - /); ny % eo aloha dia ara-bakiteny ary tsy maintsy mifanaraka araka ny nanoratana azy. Tsy manavaka sorabaventy sy soramandry ny fifanitsiana. Jereo ny Fomba Fampifanitsiana ny Tolo-kevitra ao amin'ny pejy lisitra."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
